* Koren tube models (N. Koren, 1996/2003 parameter sets)
* Triode pin order: plate grid cathode
.subckt 12AX7 p g k params: mu=100 ex=1.4 kg1=1060 kp=600 kvb=300 rgi=2000 ccg=2.3p cgp=2.4p ccp=0.9p
Be1 e1 0 V = V(p,k)/kp*ln(1+exp(kp*(1/mu+V(g,k)/sqrt(kvb+V(p,k)*V(p,k)))))
Re1 e1 0 1G
Bp p k I = 2*pwr(max(V(e1),0),ex)/kg1
Rcp p k 1G
Cg g k {ccg}
Cgp g p {cgp}
Cpk p k {ccp}
Rg g gx {rgi}
Dg gx k DGRID
.model DGRID D(IS=1n RS=1 CJO=1p TT=1n)
.ends 12AX7

* Pentode pin order: plate screen grid cathode
.subckt EL34 p s g k params: mu=11 ex=1.35 kg1=650 kg2=4200 kp=60 kvb=24 rgi=1000 ccg=15p cpg=1p ccp=8p
Be1 e1 0 V = max(V(s,k),1m)/kp*ln(1+exp(kp*(1/mu+V(g,k)/max(V(s,k),1m))))
Re1 e1 0 1G
Bp p k I = 2*pwr(max(V(e1),0),ex)/kg1*atan(V(p,k)/kvb)
* Screen: same E1 term as plate (Koren form gives ~0 near bias), plus cathode-current
* conservation: plate current lost to the atan knee is diverted to the screen (modification)
Bs s k I = 2*pwr(max(V(e1),0),ex)*(1/kg2 + (1.5707963-atan(max(V(p,k),0)/kvb))/kg1)
Rcp p k 1G
Cg g k {ccg}
Cgp g p {cpg}
Cpk p k {ccp}
Rg g gx {rgi}
Dg gx k DGRIDP
.model DGRIDP D(IS=1n RS=1 CJO=1p TT=1n)
.ends EL34
